Zero point energy                ...      0.22960071 Eh     144.08 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01181239 Eh       7.41 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
